    // Description of the delegate AI tool
    aiToolDelegateDesc: 'Delegate a task to a specialised profile. Creates a new profile if profileId is not provided. Use type="data" for data analysis, type="widget" (with widgetType) for widget configuration, or type="layout" for positioning. Set isAnswer=true when relaying user responses to pending questions.',
    // Description of the list delegates AI tool
    aiToolListDelegatesDesc: "List all active delegates in the current thread. Returns profile IDs, types, names, and message counts. Optionally filter by type (data, widget, layout, or all). Useful for tracking delegated work.",
    // Description of the ask user AI tool
    aiToolAskUserDesc: "Pause execution and ask the user a clarifying question. The question will be displayed in the main chat, and execution will resume when the user responds. Include context to help the user understand why you need this information.",
    // Description of the report results AI tool
    aiToolReportResultsDesc: 'Report task completion back to the coordinator. Provide a clear summary of what was accomplished. Set status to "complete" when fully done, "partial" if some work remains, or "blocked" if you cannot proceed. Include blockedReason when status is blocked.',
    // Description of the finish AI tool
    aiToolFinishDesc: 'Complete your task and return results to the main profile. Provide a summary of what was accomplished. Set status to "complete" when fully done, "partial" if some work remains, or "needs_info" if you need more information from the user. When status is "needs_info", include a clear question.',
    // Description of the delegate_to AI tool
    aiToolDelegateToDesc: 'Delegate a task to a specialised profile. Specify type="data" for data analysis, type="widget" (with widgetType) for widget configuration, or type="layout" for positioning. The delegate will run to completion and return its results.',
    // Description of the auto-arrange widgets layout AI tool
    aiToolAutoArrangeWidgetsDesc: 'Automatically arrange all widgets on studio grid. Choose strategy: "compact" for minimal spacing, "spacious" for more breathing room, or "balanced" for moderate spacing. Optionally preserve relative positions between widgets.',
    // Description of the move widget layout AI tool
    aiToolMoveWidgetDesc: "Move a widget to a specific position on studio grid. Specify the target column (x) and row (y). The widget's size is preserved. Use view_layout first to understand current positions.",
    // Description of the view layout AI tool
    aiToolViewLayoutDesc: "Query the current studio layout state. Returns widget positions (xTrack, yTrack), sizes (xSpan, ySpan), widget types, and page layout settings (columns, row height, padding). Optionally filter to specific widget IDs.",
    // Description of the add widget AI tool
    aiToolAddWidgetDesc: "Create and position widgets from configurations. Takes an array of widget configs with their positions and creates standalone widgets on studio. Can optionally auto-arrange all widgets after adding new ones.",
    // Description of the view schema AI tool
    aiToolViewSchemaDesc: "Explore the data schema to understand available data. Returns all fieldsets (entities/tables) with their fields, data types, and structure. Optionally pass a fieldsetId to focus on a specific entity.",
